        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heinrich August Marschner, Ludwig van Beethoven, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Albums: Moog Indigo\n- Musical works: The Turkish March (Marcia alla turca)\n- Concepts: German opera, Turkish style in classical music\n\nFacts:\n- Heinrich August Marschner was described as the most important composer of German opera between Weber and Ludwig van Beethoven.\n- The Turkish March, also called Marcia alla turca, is a well-known classical march theme.\n- The Turkish March was written in the Turkish style that was popular in music at the time.\n- The music covered on the album Moog Indigo was written by Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.",
